{"reviewId": "224589199_8b9CRCa7K", "review": {"abstract": "，贫富分化对经济增长约束的显现，是起飞完成的社会标志之一。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "1. 起飞阶段（工业化高速期）\n投资驱动、工业化扩张，大量新岗位被创造。\n[经济高速扩张；虽然贫富差距在拉大，但普通人收入也在快速上涨；大众消费持续扩张，可以消化产能]\n——贫富分化存在，但不构成约束。\n​\n2. 起飞完成（工业化基本走完）\n[新增工业红利消失，高增长时代结束。财富分配不均开始暴露，富人积累了资产，普通居民收入提升停滞，负债抬升。社会总消费被压制，产能过剩开始出现]\n——贫富分化变成约束经济增长的现实力量，这就是起飞完成的标志。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 224589199, "name": "番石榴", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/BfLozqlBiaqUk95jnQIIl7iaNXQBVDuw9WcNfagcaAEMY7tbe2iavj5libh0hic6C4Tzkj07lwaD8blNIlOkTEByRDAoHN3z1CJs1WYloL3icuH04/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20230605-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "7640-7669", "createTime": 1786005413, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "224589199_8b9CRCa7K", "userVid": 224589199, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1786005535, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "具体表现就是通缩，债务爆雷", "reviewId": "224589199_8b9CRCa7K", "commentId": "224589199_8b9CRCa7K_c223635575_8c5yWICwe", "userVid": 223635575, "createTime": 1789296237, "author": {"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2f